1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,330
(Sheldon:)All right,
I've taken the liberty

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:04,260
(Sheldon:)of drafting
these workflow charts

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,960
(Sheldon:)which outline our various duties
and the path we will follow

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,300
(Sheldon:)as we develop
our ground-breaking new app.

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,870
(Raj:)Hey, why am I in charge
of phone support?

6
00:00:14,970 --> 00:00:17,940
(Raj:)Seems a bit racist.

7
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:19,710
(Sheldon:)A customer service
representative

8
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:22,250
(Sheldon:)with an Indian accent
will create the impression

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,850
(Sheldon:)we're a vast enterprise that
uses overseas call centers.

10
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,480
(Leonard:)Oh.

11
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,820
(Raj:)Very clever.

12
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,890
(Raj:)But still racist.

13
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:33,920
(Sheldon:)Duly noted, Steve
from Wichita.

14
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:37,560
(Howard:)Why am I listed as your
executive assistant?

15
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:40,330
Because the word "secretary"
has fallen into disrepute.

16
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:43,230
(Sheldon:)FYI, my mother's
birthday is coming up.

17
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:46,040
(Sheldon:)I'm going to need you
to pick up a present.

18
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:49,460
(Leonard:)Okay, we need
to stop for a minute.

19
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,010
(Sheldon:)Leonard, please,
we can talk during our break.

20
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,480
(Sheldon:)We have one coming up
at midnight.

21
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,640
(Sheldon:)We'll need snacks.

22
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:55,950
(Leonard:)Sheldon, you're not in charge.

23
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:57,800
(Leonard:)It's my idea.
I'm in charge.

24
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,050
(Sheldon:)Oh, of course you are.

25
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:00,380
(Sheldon:)Look at the organizational
chart.

